## Summary

This is Spring PetClinic (REST). All the owner-creation and city-capacity logic lives in the **V1 controller** (`OwnerRestControllerV1`), not in a separate service. The `capacityWarning` field the tests expect **does not yet exist** — it needs to be added to the OpenAPI schema (which generates `OwnerDto`) and populated in the controller. There is also **no repository method that counts owners per city** — counting is currently done in-memory over `findAllOwners()`.

